## 2. Normative Language

The terms **MUST**, **MUST NOT**, **SHOULD**, **SHOULD NOT**, and **MAY** are normative.

A coding agent implementing this specification MUST distinguish:

* a mandatory v1 requirement;
* an explicitly deferred feature;
* a proposed economic mechanism;
* an experiment-specific parameter.

The agent MUST NOT implement proposed economic modules merely because they appear in the catalog.

