## 11. Signed Action Envelope

```rust
pub struct SignedAction {
    pub version: ProtocolVersion,
    pub chain_id: ChainId,
    pub actor: ActorId,
    pub nonce: u64,
    pub valid_until_height: u64,
    pub payload: Action,
    pub signature: Ed25519Signature,
}
```

The actor’s nonce MUST increase exactly by one for each accepted action.

An expired action is invalid.

An invalid signature, incorrect chain ID, invalid nonce, unsupported protocol version, malformed payload, or oversized field invalidates the action.

A block containing any invalid action is invalid.

The node ingress path SHOULD reject invalid actions before they enter the pending pool, but consensus verification MUST repeat all checks.

