## 42. Mechanism Hardening Loop

The development loop is:

```text
agents exploit network
→ exploit trace becomes artifact
→ exploit reproduces deterministically
→ causal defect identified
→ new hypothesis proposed
→ new module or module version implemented
→ old exploit replayed
→ unconstrained agents search for new strategies
→ result assessed
