## 43. Dogfooding

Once the network can validate real repositories, changes to the network itself become eligible jobs:

```text
protocol PR
→ validation contract
→ autonomous validation operators
→ evidence and attestations
→ challenge period
→ human merge decision
```

Agents do not receive automatic merge authority.

The network validates its own implementation and mechanism changes but does not govern itself in v1.

A mechanism change is not accepted merely because incumbent validators approved it. It must also satisfy its preregistered experiment.

